12 0 obj<</ActualText(A responsive website redesign for Royal Rhino Riders \(RRR\), a motorcycle community focused on group rides, social activities, charity programs, skill development, and community engagement.)/K[3]/P 67 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
