20 0 obj<</ActualText(The existing website contained important information about Royal Rhino Riders, but the content and visual presentation could be improved to create a clearer and more engaging experience for visitors.)/K[11]/P 75 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
21 0 obj<</ActualText( ’Goals)/K[12]/P 76 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
22 0 obj<</ActualText(The goal of the redesign was to:)/K[13]/P 77 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
23 0 obj<</ActualText( Improve the overall visual hierarchy.\n Create a clearer and more structured layout.\n Showcase the organization's activities and programs.\n Strengthen the motorcycle community's visual identity.)/K[14]/P 78 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
24 0 obj<</ActualText( ’Target Users)/K[15]/P 79 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
25 0 obj<</ActualText( ’Key insights)/K[16]/P 80 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
26 0 obj<</ActualText(During the redesign, I focused on improving the way users discover and understand the organization.)/K[17]/P 81 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
27 0 obj<</K[18]/P 82 0 R/S/Span/Pg 8 0 R/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
