45 0 obj<</ActualText(An interactive prototype was created in Figma to demonstrate the website's navigation and overall user journey. \nThe prototype allows users to explore the main sections of the website, including the organization's introduction, about section, programs, events, and contact area.)/K[36]/P 100 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
46 0 obj<</ActualText(View Interactive Prototype ’ )/K[37]/P 101 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
47 0 obj<</ActualText( ’Design System)/K[38]/P 102 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
48 0 obj<</ActualText(A 60-30-10 palette  white for space, #2D0804 for structure, 007FFF for the one action that matters on each screen)/K[39]/P 103 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
49 0 obj<</ActualText(#FFFFFF)/K[40]/P 104 0 R/Pg 8 0 R/S/Span/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
